---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_AUTHOR, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<Layout title="关于" description="关于这个数字空间和它的主人">
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="about-hero">
      <div class="portrait-wrapper">
        <div class="portrait-frame">
          <div class="portrait-placeholder">
            <span class="portrait-initials">{SITE_AUTHOR.charAt(0)}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="portrait-glow"></div>
      </div>

      <h1 class="about-name">{SITE_AUTHOR}</h1>
      <p class="about-tagline">一个普通的人，一些不普通的记忆</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="content-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span class="title-mark">◇</span>
          关于这个地方
        </h2>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>
            这里是 <strong>{SITE_TITLE}</strong>，一个存放记忆与思念的数字空间。
            在信息飞速流转的时代，我们需要一个安静的角落，
            让那些珍贵的回忆有处安放，让思念能够缓慢地、温柔地流淌。
          </p>
          <p>
            这个博客不以追热点、求流量为目的。它更像一本私人相册，
            或者一个安静的书房——你可以随时进来，坐一会儿，
            读几行字，想起某个人，或者只是发呆。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span class="title-mark">◇</span>
          关于分类
        </h2>
        <div class="section-body">
          <div class="category-intro">
            <div class="cat-intro-item">
              <span class="cat-icon">❀</span>
              <div class="cat-info">
                <span class="cat-name">回忆</span>
                <span class="cat-desc">那些过去的人和事，在记忆里永不褪色</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cat-intro-item">
              <span class="cat-icon">✉</span>
              <div class="cat-info">
                <span class="cat-name">书信</span>
                <span class="cat-desc">写给某个人的话，也许永远不会寄出</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cat-intro-item">
              <span class="cat-icon">✎</span>
              <div class="cat-info">
                <span class="cat-name">随笔</span>
                <span class="cat-desc">日常的思考与感悟，碎片式的记录</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cat-intro-item">
              <span class="cat-icon">◐</span>
              <div class="cat-info">
                <span class="cat-name">影像</span>
                <span class="cat-desc">用照片和画面，凝固某个瞬间</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cat-intro-item">
              <span class="cat-icon">♪</span>
              <div class="cat-info">
                <span class="cat-name">诗句</span>
                <span class="cat-desc">喜欢的文字，摘抄和自己写的小诗</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span class="title-mark">◇</span>
          一些小事
        </h2>
        <div class="section-body">
          <ul class="facts-list">
            <li>喜欢下雨天，更喜欢雨停之后泥土的味道</li>
            <li>收藏旧书，书页上有时间的痕迹</li>
            <li>拍过很多张天空的照片，每一张都不一样</li>
            <li>相信有些思念，会以另一种方式抵达</li>
            <li>觉得慢慢走，也挺好的</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          <span class="title-mark">◇</span>
          联系
        </h2>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>
            如果你在这里看到了自己的影子，或者想说点什么，
            欢迎到<a href="/#guestbook">留言板</a>留下你的话语。
            每一条留言，都会被认真对待。
          </p>
          <p class="signature">
            —— {SITE_AUTHOR}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.about-page {
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 60px 24px;
}

.about-hero {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 64px;
}

.portrait-wrapper {
  position: relative;
  width: 120px;
  height: 120px;
  margin: 0 auto 24px;
}

.portrait-frame {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-primary);
  padding: 4px;
  z-index: 1;
}

.portrait-placeholder {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(
    135deg,
    var(--color-bg-secondary) 0%,
    var(--color-accent-secondary) 100%
  );
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.portrait-initials {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  opacity: 0.6;
}

.portrait-glow {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  width: 160px;
  height: 160px;
  background: radial-gradient(
    circle,
    rgba(184, 151, 122, 0.15) 0%,
    transparent 70%
  );
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: breathe 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes breathe {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
  50% { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1); }
}

.about-name {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.about-tagline {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  font-style: italic;
}

.content-section {
  margin-bottom: 48px;
}

.section-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  padding-bottom: 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-soft);
}

.title-mark {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--color-accent-primary);
}

.section-body {
  line-height: 1.9;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
}

.section-body p {
  margin-bottom: 1.2em;
}

.section-body p:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.section-body strong {
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.section-body a {
  color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-accent-secondary);
  transition: all 0.3s var(--ease-smooth);
}

.section-body a:hover {
  border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
}

/* Category Intro */
.category-intro {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.cat-intro-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 16px;
  background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
  border-radius: 8px;
  transition: all 0.3s var(--ease-smooth);
}

.cat-intro-item:hover {
  transform: translateX(4px);
}

.cat-icon {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 32px;
  text-align: center;
}

.cat-info {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}

.cat-name {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
}

.cat-desc {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* Facts List */
.facts-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}

.facts-list li {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
}

.facts-list li::before {
  content: '·';
  position: absolute;
  left: 8px;
  top: 0;
  color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  font-size: 1.2em;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.facts-list li:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.signature {
  text-align: right;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--color-text-tertiary) !important;
  margin-top: 24px !important;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .about-page {
    padding: 40px 16px;
  }

  .about-name {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
}
</style>
